    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d630-a3">

                <pb facs="0671" n="621" xml:id="pg621"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 188.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Secretary of the Treasury informs me that all goods arriving at ports of entry of
                    the United States after midnight of August 27th instant will be subject to the
                    duties prescribed by our new tariff law irrespective of the time of
                    shipment.</p>
            </div>
